{"meta":{"id":"spring-iot-data","category":"it/projects/done","title":"IoT 데이터 관리 웹 (Spring MVC)","subtitle":"","summary":"Spring MVC + MyBatis + MySQL — 회원 · 상품 · 제품 권한 관리, 기상청 데이터 1시간 수집, 차트 · 메모, 이메일 인증 · 비밀번호 암호화","tags":["spring","spring mvc","mybatis","mysql","iot","tiles","interceptor","scheduled","기상청 api","java"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"javaProjectS7","updatedAt":"2024-01-31"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>SPRING</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2024-01-31</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">IoT 데이터 관리 웹 (Spring MVC)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> Spring MVC + MyBatis + MySQL — 회원 · 상품 · 제품 권한 관리, 기상청 데이터 1시간 수집, 차트 · 메모, 이메일 인증 · 비밀번호 암호화</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">개요</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Java 웹 · 데이터 융합 개발자(스프링, DB) 과정에서 만든 <strong>IoT 제품 데이터 관리 · 분석 웹사이트</strong>입니다. IoT 를 잘 활용하려면 데이터 관리가 핵심이라는 생각에서 출발해, 회사(구매자)가 상품별 제품을 등록하면 제품이 보내는 온도 · 습도 데이터를 저장하고 차트 · 메모로 관리하며, 회원마다 제품별 권한을 나눠 줍니다. 실제 기기가 없어서 기상청 초단기예보(기온 · 습도)를 1시간마다 받아 제품 데이터로 저장했습니다.</p><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">언어</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">JAVA 11, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">프레임워크</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Spring MVC (STS4), MyBatis, Spring Security(암호화), Apache Tiles, Quartz · @Scheduled</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">라이브러리</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">jQuery, JSTL, Jackson, commons-fileupload, Lombok, JavaMail, swiper, dygraph · 구글 차트</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">DB · WAS</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">MySQL 5.7 (connector 5.1), Apache Tomcat 9.0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">개발 기간</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2023-10 ~ 2024-01 (Proto 1 → Proto 2(JSP) → Ver 1.0(Spring 변환))</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">실행 화면</h2></div><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/projects/assets/spring-iot-data/01-login.png\" alt=\"로그인 — 아이디 · 비밀번호, 카카오 로그인, 가입 요청 · 비밀번호 찾기\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">로그인 — 아이디 · 비밀번호, 카카오 로그인, 가입 요청 · 비밀번호 찾기</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/projects/assets/spring-iot-data/02-signup.png\" alt=\"가입 신청 — 이메일 인증번호, 시리얼번호(제품) 입력\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">가입 신청 — 이메일 인증번호, 시리얼번호(제품) 입력</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/projects/assets/spring-iot-data/03-find-password.png\" alt=\"비밀번호 찾기 — 아이디 · 이메일로 새 비밀번호 전송\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">비밀번호 찾기 — 아이디 · 이메일로 새 비밀번호 전송</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/projects/assets/spring-iot-data/04-product-list.png\" alt=\"상품 목록 — swiper 슬라이드 (가정용 · 산업용 · 농업용 온습도)\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">상품 목록 — swiper 슬라이드 (가정용 · 산업용 · 농업용 온습도)</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/projects/assets/spring-iot-data/05-device-list.png\" alt=\"상품별 제품(디바이스) 목록 — 현재 온습도 · 정상/이상 상태, 온습도 차트\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">상품별 제품(디바이스) 목록 — 현재 온습도 · 정상/이상 상태, 온습도 차트</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/projects/assets/spring-iot-data/06-device-detail.png\" alt=\"제품 상세 — 달력 메모, 기간별(3 · 6 · 9개월 · 1년) 산점도 차트, 측정 이력 표\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">제품 상세 — 달력 메모, 기간별(3 · 6 · 9개월 · 1년) 산점도 차트, 측정 이력 표</figcaption></figure><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">화면은 발표자료(pptx)에 넣었던 캡처입니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">요구사항 (요약)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">구분</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">요구사항</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">회원 (11)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">아이디 중복 · 형식(영문 · 숫자 3~20자), 비밀번호 형식(특수문자 포함 6~20자) · 재확인, 이메일 인증, 카카오 가입 · 로그인, 아이디 찾기, 임시 비밀번호 발급 · 변경, 탈퇴</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">상품 (4)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상품 등록, 고유번호, 회사 · 종류별 분류, 판매 중지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">제품 (13)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상품별 제품 등록 · 고유번호, 통신 Key 로 데이터 수신 · 저장, 데이터 차트, 날짜별 메모, 제품별 회원 권한, 시리얼 번호로 제품 추가, 이미지 · 설명 수정, 통신 상태 확인 · 오류 보고</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">작업 이력</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">기간</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">버전</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2023-10-04 ~ 10-05</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Proto 1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">회원 관리 DB 구조 생성 및 로그</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2023-11-28 ~ 12-01</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Proto 2</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">서버 화면 · DB 구조 구상, Front 작업, 차트 출력</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2024-01-02 ~ 01-03</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Ver 1.0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Proto 2 (JSP) → Spring 변환</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2024-01-04 ~ 01-12</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Ver 1.0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">메모 기능, DB 구조 관리 · 차트 출력</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2024-01-15 ~ 01-25</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Ver 1.0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">회원 관련, 제품 추가 · 수정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2024-01-29 ~ 01-30</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Ver 1.0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">더미 데이터 추가 및 테스트</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">프로젝트 구성</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">tree</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">javaProjectS7/\r\n├─ pom.xml\r\n└─ src/main/\r\n   ├─ java/com/spring/javaProjectS7/\r\n   │  ├─ controller/   Users · Products · BuyProducts · Report · Message · Error Ctrl\r\n   │  ├─ service/      User · Product · BuyProducts Service(+Impl)\r\n   │  ├─ dao/          Userdao · Priductdao · BuyProductsdao · Scheduledao · Statusdao …\r\n   │  ├─ vo/           UserVO · ProductsVO · BuyProductsVO · ScheduleVO · StatisTypesVO …\r\n   │  ├─ interceptor/  BuyProductInterceptor (제품 화면 권한)\r\n   │  └─ common/       FileManager · PasswordCk · ARIAEngine/Util · SecurityUtil · Log · threadDateCk(스케줄러)\r\n   │                   filer/EncodingFilter\r\n   ├─ resources/       mappers/*.xml (MyBatis), log4j.xml\r\n   └─ webapp/\r\n      ├─ resources/    css · js · data(업로드 이미지: product · buyProduct · common)\r\n      └─ WEB-INF/\r\n         ├─ web.xml\r\n         ├─ spring/    root-context.xml · appServlet/(servlet-context · servlet-interceptor · mainViwer(Tiles)).xml\r\n         └─ views/     user · product · buyproduct · common(header · footer · mainFrame) · errorPage</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">서버 구조</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70 p-3 sm:p-4 overflow-x-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">Client</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">Filter</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">한글 · 접근 확인</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">Interceptor</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">권한별 접근</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">Controller</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">Service</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">데이터 변환</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">DAO · MyBatis</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">MySQL</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">@Scheduled (1시간)</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">threadDateCk</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-emerald-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">초단기예보 API</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">기온 · 습도</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">정상 범위 판정</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">buyproductids_N</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">제품별 저장</span></span></div></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설정 파일</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">web.xml</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">welcome-file, root-context · appServlet(/) 등록, EncodingFilter(/*), error-page (400 · 404 · 405 · 500 · NumberFormat · NullPointer)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">root-context.xml</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">DataSource + MyBatis(SqlSessionFactory · Template), JavaMail(Gmail SMTP, TLS), 스케줄러(task:scheduler / executor, annotation-driven)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">servlet-context.xml</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">정적 자원 매핑(images · css · js), Tiles 뷰 우선 → JSP 뷰, Security(암호화 빈), MultipartResolver</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">servlet-interceptor.xml</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">/buyproduct/** 에 권한 인터셉터 — 읽기 · 쓰기 레벨별 접근 허용</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">mainViwer.xml (Tiles)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">header · footer 고정 + 본문만 교체하는 레이아웃. 뷰는 WEB-INF 안에 두어 직접 접근 차단</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">URL 구성</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">경로</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">기능</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">/user</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Login(GET · POST), KakaoLogin, Join, EmailCk · EmailCkOk(이메일 인증), PswdEmail(임시 비밀번호), PswdChange, Logout</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">/product</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">ProductList, ProductJoin, ProductJoinSave · SavePhoto</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">/buyproduct</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">BuyProductList(GET · POST), BuyProductView, ScheduleCk · ScheduleOk(메모), BuyProductChange, BuyProductReport, BuyProductJoin · Save · SavePhoto, BuyProductDataSave · SavePhoto, UserManage, SerialUpdate</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">/report</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">reportDataIn, dataIn, dataInCk (제품 데이터 수신)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">/msg/{msgType}/{msgFlag}</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">알림 메시지 후 이동 (로그인 필요 · 권한 부족 등)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">/errorPage</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">error400 · 404 · 405 · 500 · NullPointer · NumberFormat</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">DB 설계</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">테이블</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">users</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">회원 — 가입 방식(1 이메일 · 2 카카오 · 3 그 외), 암호화된 비밀번호 + UUID, 마지막 접속 시간 · IP</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">buyers</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">제품 구매자(회사) — 이름, 상품, 수량, 구매 시각</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">products</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상품 종류 — 이름 · 버전(PK 에 포함) · 설명 · 사진</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">buyproducts</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상품별 제품 — 시리얼(UNIQUE), 통신 Key, 설치 주소, 사진, 최근 온도 · 습도 · 상태</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">buyproductids_{제품idx}</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">제품별 측정 데이터 — 온도 · 습도 · 상태 · 측정 시각 (제품마다 테이블을 따로 생성)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">statustypes</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">권한 종류 — 읽기 · 쓰기 레벨</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">statuslists</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">회원 × 상품 × 제품별 권한 지정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">schedules</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">제품별 날짜 메모 (회원 · 제품 FK)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/projects/assets/spring-iot-data/07-erd.png\" alt=\"ERD — users · buyers · products · buyproducts · statuslists · schedules, 제품별 측정 테이블 buyproductids_{idx}\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">ERD — users · buyers · products · buyproducts · statuslists · schedules, 제품별 측정 테이블 buyproductids_{idx}</figcaption></figure><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">제품이 늘어날 때마다 측정 데이터 테이블을 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>buyproductids_{제품idx}</code> 로 따로 만들어 제품별 데이터를 분리했습니다. (SQL 덤프의 테이블 구조 기준, 데이터는 옮기지 않음)</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">권한 구조</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">idx</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">이름</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">읽기 / 쓰기</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">할 수 있는 일</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">-90</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">DB 관리자</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">10 / 10</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상품 등록, 제품 등록 · 수정, 회원 관리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">-50</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">비회원</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1 / 0</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상품 · 제품 확인</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">20</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">구매자</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">3 / 3</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">제품 추가 · 확인 · 수정, 회원 관리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">21</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">제품 관리자</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">3 / 3</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">제품 추가 · 확인 · 수정, 회원 관리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">22</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">관리자</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">5 / 5</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">관리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">23</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">회원</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2 / 1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상품 확인, 제품 추가 · 확인</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">public boolean preHandle(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response, Object handler) throws Exception {\r\n\r\n    boolean bRtn = true;\r\n    String url = &quot;/msg/buyproduct/loginCk&quot;; // 기본 이동 login 화면\r\n    RequestDispatcher dispatcher = null;\r\n    HttpSession session = request.getSession();\r\n    int uerIdx = session.getAttribute(&quot;sUserIdx&quot;)==null ? -1 : (Integer) session.getAttribute(&quot;sUserIdx&quot;);\r\n\r\n    int write = session.getAttribute(&quot;sWrite&quot;)==null ? -1 : (Integer) session.getAttribute(&quot;sWrite&quot;);\r\n    int read = session.getAttribute(&quot;sRead&quot;)==null ? -1 : (Integer) session.getAttribute(&quot;sRead&quot;);\r\n\r\n    int productWrite = session.getAttribute(&quot;sBuyProductWrite&quot;)==null ? -1 : (Integer) session.getAttribute(&quot;sBuyProductWrite&quot;);\r\n    int productRead = session.getAttribute(&quot;sBuyProductRead&quot;)==null ? -1 : (Integer) session.getAttribute(&quot;sBuyProductRead&quot;);\r\n\r\n\r\n    String type =&quot;/buyproduct/&quot;;\r\n    String com = request.getRequestURI();\r\n    String work = com.substring(com.indexOf(type)+type.length(),com.length());\r\n\r\n    //안되는 케이스만 bRtn = false 처리\r\n    if(write == 10 &amp;&amp; read == 10) // Master\r\n    else if(uerIdx == -1) //로그인 유무\r\n        bRtn = false;\r\n    else {  //권한 확인\r\n        url = &quot;/msg/buyproduct/levelCk&quot;;\r\n        switch (work) {\r\n            case &quot;BuyProductChange&quot;:\r\n            case &quot;UserManage&quot;:\r\n                if(productWrite &lt; 3) //쓰기 권한 ( 관리자 이상 )\r\n                    bRtn = false;\r\n            case &quot;BuyProductView&quot;:\r\n                if(productRead == -1) //권한 확인 전인 경우, 받은 값에서 확인\r\n                 productRead = request.getParameter(&quot;readLevel&quot;) == null? -1 : Integer.valueOf(request.getParameter(&quot;readLevel&quot;)) ;\r\n\r\n                if(productRead &lt; 2) //읽기 권한 ( 회원 이상 )\r\n                    bRtn = false;\r\n                break;\r\n            case &quot;BuyProductList&quot;:\r\n            default:\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n\r\n    if(!bRtn) {\r\n        dispatcher = request.getRequestDispatcher(url);\r\n        dispatcher.forward(request, response);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    return bRtn;\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">세션의 읽기 · 쓰기 레벨과 제품별 권한을 보고, 부족하면 로그인 · 권한 안내 메시지(/msg/…)로 forward 합니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">회원 가입 — 이메일 인증</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">이메일 형식을 JS 로 확인한 뒤 Ajax 로 요청하면, UUID 8자리 인증번호를 메일로 보내고 세션에 저장합니다. 입력한 번호와 세션 값이 같으면 인증 완료이고, 이후 이메일은 수정할 수 없게 막습니다.</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">protected String emailCkPost(HttpSession session ,\r\n        @RequestParam(name=&quot;email&quot; , defaultValue=&quot;&quot;, required = true) String email\r\n        )  throws ServletException, IOException {\r\n    String rtn = &quot;0&quot;;\r\n    //email 확인 메시지 전송\r\n    UUID uid = UUID.randomUUID();\r\n    String emailKey = uid.toString().substring(0,8);\r\n\r\n    try {\r\n        rtn = mailSend(email, &quot;이메일 인증키입니다.&quot;, &quot;인증키 : &quot;+emailKey);\r\n    } catch (MessagingException e) {\r\n        // TODO Auto-generated catch block\r\n        e.printStackTrace();\r\n    }\r\n    session.setAttribute(&quot;sEmailKey&quot;, emailKey);\r\n    return rtn;\r\n}</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">비밀번호 암호화 흐름</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">단계</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">1</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">비밀번호 길이만큼 UUID 앞부분을 잘라 사용</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">비밀번호는 ARIA 로, UUID 는 SHA-256 으로 암호화</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">3</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">각각 자체 함수(ASCII 변환 + 고정 키 XOR 2회)로 한 번 더 변환</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">4</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">변환된 비밀번호와 UUID 를 XOR 로 합침</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">5</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Spring Security 인코더로 최종 인코딩 → 결과값과 UUID 를 DB 에 저장</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">로그인</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">입력 비밀번호 + 저장된 UUID 로 같은 과정을 거친 뒤 Security matches 로 비교, 접속 IP · 시간 갱신, 세션에 읽기 · 쓰기 레벨 저장</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">※ 고정 키 값은 문서에 넣지 않았습니다. 카카오 로그인은 카카오 ID 로 처음 들어오면 자동 가입(가입 방식 2) 후 로그인, 이미 있으면 그 회원으로 로그인합니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">기상청 데이터 저장 (1시간 스케줄러)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">public void dataIn() throws MessagingException, IOException {\r\nString API_KEY = &quot;&lt;서비스 키&gt;&quot;;\r\n\r\n    LocalDateTime now = LocalDateTime.now();\r\n    String formatedNow = now.format(DateTimeFormatter.ofPattern(&quot;yyyyMMdd/HHmm&quot;));\r\n    String[] parts = formatedNow.split(&quot;/&quot;);\r\n    String day = parts[0];\r\n    String time = parts[1];\r\n\r\nStringBuilder urlBuilder = new StringBuilder(&quot;http://apis.data.go.kr/1360000/VilageFcstInfoService_2.0/getUltraSrtFcst&quot;); /*URL*/\r\nurlBuilder.append(&quot;?&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;serviceKey&quot;,&quot;UTF-8&quot;) + &quot;=&quot;+API_KEY); /*Service Key*/\r\nurlBuilder.append(&quot;&amp;&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;pageNo&quot;,&quot;UTF-8&quot;) + &quot;=&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;UTF-8&quot;)); /*페이지번호*/\r\nurlBuilder.append(&quot;&amp;&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;numOfRows&quot;,&quot;UTF-8&quot;) + &quot;=&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;1000&quot;, &quot;UTF-8&quot;)); /*한 페이지 결과 수*/\r\nurlBuilder.append(&quot;&amp;&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;dataType&quot;,&quot;UTF-8&quot;) + &quot;=&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;JSON&quot;, &quot;UTF-8&quot;)); /*요청자료형식(XML/JSON) Default: XML*/\r\nurlBuilder.append(&quot;&amp;&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;base_date&quot;,&quot;UTF-8&quot;) + &quot;=&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(day, &quot;UTF-8&quot;)); /*‘21년 6월 28일 발표*/\r\nurlBuilder.append(&quot;&amp;&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;base_time&quot;,&quot;UTF-8&quot;) + &quot;=&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(time, &quot;UTF-8&quot;)); /*06시30분 발표(30분 단위)*/\r\nurlBuilder.append(&quot;&amp;&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;nx&quot;,&quot;UTF-8&quot;) + &quot;=&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;55&quot;, &quot;UTF-8&quot;)); /*예보지점 X 좌표값*/\r\nurlBuilder.append(&quot;&amp;&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;ny&quot;,&quot;UTF-8&quot;) + &quot;=&quot; + URLEncoder.encode(&quot;127&quot;, &quot;UTF-8&quot;)); /*예보지점 Y 좌표값*/\r\n\r\n\r\nURL url = new URL(urlBuilder.toString());\r\nHttpURLConnection conn = (HttpURLConnection) url.openConnection();\r\nconn.setRequestMethod(&quot;GET&quot;);\r\nconn.setRequestProperty(&quot;Content-type&quot;, &quot;application/json&quot;);\r\nBufferedReader rd;\r\nif(conn.getResponseCode() &gt;= 200 &amp;&amp; conn.getResponseCode() &lt;= 300) {\r\n    rd = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(conn.getInputStream()));\r\n} else {\r\n    rd = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(conn.getErrorStream()));\r\n}\r\nStringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\r\nString line;\r\nwhile ((line = rd.readLine()) != null) {\r\n  sb.append(line);\r\n}\r\n\r\nObjectMapper objectMapper = new ObjectMapper();\r\nJsonNode jsonNode = objectMapper.readTree(sb.toString());\r\nJsonNode itemsNode = jsonNode.path(&quot;response&quot;).path(&quot;body&quot;).path(&quot;items&quot;).path(&quot;item&quot;);\r\nint humid = -99;\r\nint temp = -99;\r\nboolean state = true;\r\nfor (JsonNode itemNode : itemsNode) {\r\n    String baseDate = itemNode.get(&quot;baseDate&quot;).asText();\r\n    String baseTime = itemNode.get(&quot;baseTime&quot;).asText();\r\n    String category = itemNode.get(&quot;category&quot;).asText();\r\n    String fcstValue = itemNode.get(&quot;fcstValue&quot;).asText();\r\n    if(category.equals(&quot;T1H&quot;)){ // T1H 기온 (℃)\r\n        temp = Integer.valueOf(fcstValue) ;\r\n    }\r\n    if(category.equals(&quot;REH&quot;) ){//REH 습도 (%)\r\n        humid = Integer.valueOf(fcstValue) ;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n        if( humid != -99 &amp;&amp; temp != -99)\r\n            break;\r\n}\r\n\r\nBuyproductids_VO vo = new Buyproductids_VO();\r\n\r\n    vo.setBuyProductIdsHumid(humid);\r\n    vo.setBuyProductIdsTemp(temp);\r\n\r\n    if( humid  &lt; -1 || 80 &lt; humid)\r\n        state = false;\r\n    if( temp &lt; -30  || 50&lt; temp )\r\n        state = false;\r\n    vo.setBuyProductIdsState(state);\r\n\r\n\r\n    ArrayList&lt;BuyProductsVO&gt; buyProductVos ;\r\n    ArrayList&lt;ProductsVO&gt; productsVos = priductdao.getPriductList();\r\n    for(ProductsVO productsVo: productsVos) {\r\n        buyProductVos = buyProductsdao.getBuyProuctListAll(productsVo.getProductsIdx());\r\n        for(BuyProductsVO buyProductVo: buyProductVos) {\r\n            int idx = buyProductVo.getBuyProductsIdx();\r\n            String  key = buyProductVo.getBuyProductIdsKey();\r\n            //데이터 조건 확인\r\n            if(buyProductsdao.selectKeyCk(idx , key) != 0)\r\n                buyproductIddao.insertData(idx , vo) ; //데이터 table 저장\r\n\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n\r\nrd.close();\r\nconn.disconnect();\r\n\r\n\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">초단기예보 응답(response.body.items.item)에서 T1H(기온) · REH(습도)를 꺼내, 온도 -30~50℃ · 습도 0~80% 를 벗어나면 비정상 상태로 표시해 모든 제품의 데이터 테이블에 저장합니다. (서비스 키는 가림)</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">제품 화면 기능</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">기능</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">상품 · 제품 목록</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">swiper 로 페이지를 나눠 카드 표시, 권한이 없으면 제한된 정보만</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">데이터 차트</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">구글 차트 · dygraph 로 온도 · 습도 추이, 최근 데이터 개월별 출력</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">메모 달력</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Ajax 로 메모 목록을 받아 년 · 월 달력 table 생성 — 메모 있는 날 · 토 · 일 · 다른 달을 클래스로 구분, 날짜를 눌러 등록 · 수정</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">제품 정보 수정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">이미지 · 설명 수정, 시리얼 번호로 제품 추가</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">제품별 회원 권한</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">제품마다 회원의 권한 등급 지정 (UserManage)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">파일 업로드</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>{idx}_yyyyMMdd_HHmmss_{원본파일명}</code> 형식으로 resources/data 아래에 저장</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">함께 보관한 자료</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">자료</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">온도자료/*.xlsx</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">지역별 일별 기상 자료 — Day · Area(지점 번호) · rainfall_mm · temp_avr · temp_low · temp_high, 2021-01-01 ~ 2023-08-05 (947일)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">data/</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">업로드된 상품 · 제품 이미지와 공통 로고 · 헤더 버튼 이미지</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">javaproject7_*.sql</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">MySQL 덤프 (테이블 구조 + 더미 데이터)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-emerald-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Spring 프로젝트*.pptx</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">발표 자료 (제작 동기, 요구사항, 화면 · DB · 코드 구조, 기능 리뷰, 느낀 점)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"